    </p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Maintain an Updated Media Kit:</strong> Keep a concise 2-page media kit detailing your audience demographics (age, location, gender split), verified engagement rates, and case studies from past brand partnerships.</li>
      <li><strong>Personalize Every Brand Outreach Pitch:</strong> When pitching brands, cite a specific recent product launch or campaign they ran, explain why your audience aligns with their target customer, and propose a concrete creative concept.</li>
      <li><strong>Deliver Post-Campaign Performance Reports:</strong> Within 7 days of posting, send the brand a clean analytics wrap-up report with verified screenshots of impressions, link clicks, watch time, and positive community comments. This professional follow-up is the #1 driver of recurring sponsorship retainers.</li>
    </ol>
